%% Context Hygiene — Archiving & Trimming Flow
%% Shows what happens during govern archiving and spec/gather lifecycle

flowchart TD
    subgraph Govern["gig:govern — Archive Iteration"]
        A[Step 9: Archive Iteration] --> B[Copy PLAN, DECISIONS, ISSUES, GOVERNANCE]
        B --> C[Copy .gig/design/ to archive]
        C --> D[Trim STATE.md batch history to 20 rows]
        D --> E[Trim ARCHITECTURE.md audit log to 5 entries]
        E --> F[Clear active files]
    end

    subgraph Gather["gig:gather — Start New Iteration"]
        G[Step 3b: System Diagrams] --> H[Clear .gig/design/]
        H --> I[Generate new diagrams]
    end

    subgraph Spec["gig:spec — New Spec"]
        J[Guard Check] --> K{All REQs COVERED?}
        K -->|Yes| L[Archive to SPEC-completed-date.md]
        K -->|No| M[Warn: uncovered requirements]
        L --> N[Start elicitation]
        M --> N
    end

    Govern --> Gather
    Govern --> Spec
